  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_0611.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(80 fotos) Onda Centre Comercial (OCC) ha entregado esta pasada semana los premios de la campa&ntilde;a de San Valent&iacute;n, &#39;Feli&ccedil; Dia de l&#39;Amor i l&#39;Amistat&#39;. Su secretario adjunto, Ram&oacute;n Jordan Cameselle, ha anunciado novedades para el mes de marzo, al coincidir este a&ntilde;o con el 15&ordm; aniversario de la asociaci&oacute;n. Pr&oacute;ximamente se desvelar&aacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470228.jpg\" alt=\"p1470228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470231.jpg\" alt=\"p1470231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470234.jpg\" alt=\"p1470234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470235.jpg\" alt=\"p1470235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470236.jpg\" alt=\"p1470236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470237.jpg\" alt=\"p1470237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470238.jpg\" alt=\"p1470238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campanyasantvalenti17occ/p1470239.jpg\" alt=\"p1470239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.